# A turn that stops on a question (red) and continues after the answer.
# Claude asks through its AskUserQuestion tool; a PermissionRequest would go
# red → green without the yellow after the answer.
wait
hook UserPromptSubmit
say Looking at the change… (Enter to go on)
wait
hook PreToolUse "tool_name":"AskUserQuestion"
say Apply the change? (answer, then Enter)
wait
hook PostToolUse "tool_name":"AskUserQuestion"
say Applying… (Enter to go on)
wait
say Done.
hook Stop
